# SwitchBranches without a selected issue fails, in a real run and in a dry run, before any Git access (there is no
# repository here).
! exec remeris switch
! stdout .
cmp stderr no_issue.err

! exec remeris --dry-run switch
! stdout .
cmp stderr no_issue.err

-- knope.toml --
[[workflows]]
name = "switch"
[[workflows.steps]]
type = "SwitchBranches"
-- no_issue.err --
Error: Problem with workflow switch
  ╰─▶ No issue selected
      help: Switching branches requires selecting an issue first with SelectGitHubIssue or SelectJiraIssue
